            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Telugu for national, then the Telugu for politics."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: శాసనసభ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "శాసనసభ — śāsanasabha — \"a legislative assembly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "కొత్త చట్టం గురించి శాసనసభలో చర్చ జరిగింది. kotta caṭṭaṁ guriñci śāsanasabhalō carca jarigindi. There was a debate in the assembly about the new law."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "శాసన, law-making, + సభ, an assembly. Its members are శాసనసభ్యులు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "శాసనసభ (śāsanasabha) is built from Sanskrit śāsana, \"instructing; a command, a royal edict\" (CDIAL 12420), and sabhā, \"an assembly, a hall\" (CDIAL 13167)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
